# Fails the run instead of hanging it.
#
# `01-selftest.sk` stops the server itself, so a server that is still up this much later means the
# self-test never got that far: either Skript rejected the script, or the addon did not load and its
# elements were unknown. Nothing here uses addon syntax, so this file runs either way.
#
# The self-test's own `PASS` marker is what `serverTest` looks for; this marker only explains why it
# is missing.

every 30 seconds:
    log "XIAOJIE_SELFTEST=FAIL the self-test did not stop the server within 30 seconds"
    stop the server
